  AppStream metadata skeleton for BlueMesh.

  App id io.github.bluemesh_app.BlueMesh matches the GitHub account
  bluemesh-app (https://github.com/bluemesh-app/BlueMesh); Flathub maps the
  hyphen to an underscore.

  TODO: replace the placeholder donation URL below.
